{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "8f1c2b47-5d3e-4a91-9c6e-2b7a10d4f6c8",
    "name": "gitark",
    "description": "Collection for the gitark git server API (Gin).\n\nRoutes:\n- GET  /\n- POST /user/create\n- POST /user/login\n- GET  /user/me        (auth)\n- POST /repo/create    (auth)\n- GET  /repo/list      (auth)\n\nRun **User > Log In** first: its test script stores the JWT in the `token` collection variable, which every protected request sends as `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          ""
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:4000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
